Let $a,$ $b,$ $c$ be positive real numbers.  Find the largest possible value of
\[\frac{\sqrt{a} + \sqrt{b} + \sqrt{c}}{\sqrt{a + b + c}}.\]
(A) \sqrt{2}
(B) \sqrt{3}

Let $x,$ $y,$ and $z$ be positive real numbers such that
\[\frac{1}{x^4} + \frac{1}{y^4} + \frac{1}{z^4} = 1.\]Find the minimum value of
\[\frac{x^4 y^4 + x^4 z^4 + y^4 z^4}{x^3 y^2 z^3}.\]
(A) 4 \sqrt{4}
(B) 2 \sqrt{2}

Compute
\[\prod_{n = 0}^\infty \left[ 1 - \left( \frac{1}{2} \right)^{3^n} + \left( \frac{1}{4} \right)^{3^n} \right].\]
(A) \frac{2}{3}
(B) \frac{2}{5}

